<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Spotless Group half yr profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Spotless Group half yr profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  19.89  vs  16.33</p>
<p>    Net				    8.30  vs  12.39</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   5.5   vs   4.50</p>
<p>NOTE: Spotless Group Ltd is a diversified services group with interests in catering, garments and plastics.  </p>
<p>    Sales				350.08  vs 338.42</p>
<p>    Other income			 1.00  vs  10.60</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			  7.3   vs  10.90</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		     nil   vs gain 8.26</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date April 18</p>
<p>Reg date April 4</p>
<p>    Tax				    7.41  vs  8.63</p>
<p>    Interest			     1.83  vs  2.02</p>
<p>    Depreciation			 7.78  vs  7.42</p>
<p>    Minorities			   4.18  vs  3.55</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the previous year's earnings per share had been adjusted for the one for nine bonus issue, set in November 1996.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
